# OPTIONAL. Leave this file unused if you are running with a local Chrome —
# that is the default and needs no credentials.
#
# Only set BRIGHTDATA_WSS if Google starts blocking your IP and you want to
# route through Bright Data's Scraping Browser instead (this costs money).
# BRIGHTDATA_WSS=wss://brd-customer-XXXX-zone-YYYY-country-de:PASSWORD@brd.superproxy.io:9222

# Optional: use a specific Chrome instead of the auto-detected one.
# CHROME_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome
